                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Spoke at the reopening of the inpatient rehab unit at Frye Regional, which has served the Catawba Valley for over a century. \n\nIt was great to meet the team and see the difference they\u2019re making for patients and families throughout the region. https://t.co/kU37U9KiBo",
