                "quoted_status_profile_username": "greg_price11",
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If @DHSgov cannot detain illegal immigrants, every person who crosses is released into American communities that are already overwhelmed. Pair that with taxpayer-funded lawyers, and the costs fall straight onto working families through crowded schools, strained hospitals, and higher local budgets. \n\nDemocrats continue to choose policies that make life harder for the very people they represent.",
